const introParagraphs = [
  "<strong>When an appliance fails in Goleta, our techs at Same Day Appliance Repair are usually looking at the workhorse brands: LG and Samsung in the newer western-Goleta construction, Whirlpool and GE in the postwar tracts off Cathedral Oaks and Hollister, and hard-run rental-property machines near the university that see more cycles in a school year than most family appliances see in three. We dispatch same-day across Old Town, Ellwood, Winchester Canyon, and the Goleta Valley. $89 residential diagnostic, waived with repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal certified (#1346255700410), BBB Accredited.</strong>",
  "Goleta is the practical end of the South Coast, and we like it that way. While the estate side of our territory runs on built-in refrigeration columns, Goleta runs on French-door LGs from the big-box store, Samsung laundry pairs, Whirlpool dishwashers, and GE ranges — machines that are absolutely worth repairing and absolutely not worth replacing at the first fault. A $250 repair on a five-year-old LG refrigerator is nearly always the right call, and we'll tell you plainly when it isn't.",
