  "The weather here matters more than people think. Goleta sits deeper in the fog belt than Santa Barbara proper — cooler days, damper mornings, marine layer that hangs on past noon. Dryers feel it first: a vent run that's marginal in a dry climate becomes a genuinely slow, genuinely unsafe vent here, because damp lint packs harder and airflow drops further. If your dryer needs two cycles, that's not the heating element being weak — that's usually the vent, and it's also the fire-risk item. We check vent flow on every Goleta dryer call.",
  `Diagnostic fee: <strong>$89</strong> — waived with repair. Written estimate before we start. <strong>90-day warranty</strong> on parts and labor. Call <a href="tel:${phoneRaw}">${branch.phone}</a> for same-day service across 93117 and the Goleta Valley — and the rest of the <a href="/santa-barbara-county/">South Coast corridor</a>.`
];

